data: {"id": "96d37e17556142f1-thinking-parallel_evidence-1231", "run_id": "96d37e17556142f1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集的事实、冲突与缺口如下：\n\n## 实体身份与生命周期\n- **身份确认**：Pod `workload-5c9c7b6489-fl85h` (`f371c9da-cbaf-447f-8ec3-e90fd82caa5d`)，命名空间 `aiops-case-08`，运行于 `node2`。\n- **当前状态**：Pod 整体 `phase: Running`，但 `Ready` 状态为 `False`，状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`，重启次数已达 16 次，最近一次重启约 3m47s 前。\n\n## 支持候选原因的证据\n- **CrashLoopBackOff**：`kubectl_get_by_name` 明确显示状态为 `CrashLoopBackOff`；`kubectl_events` 显示 `Back-off restarting failed container`，间隔长达 72 分钟。\n- **OOMKill**：`kubectl_describe` 明确指出 Exit Code 为 `137`，Reason 为 `OOMKilled`。\n- **内存持续", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788453899532, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

